OVERVIEW: Lists test methods in specifier format

USAGE: swift test list [--skip-build] [--enable-xctest] [--disable-xctest] [--enable-swift-testing] [--disable-swift-testing] [--attachments-path <attachments-path>]

OPTIONS:
  --skip-build            Skip building the test target.
  --enable-xctest/--disable-xctest
                          Determines whether the build includes XCTest support.
  --enable-swift-testing/--disable-swift-testing
                          Determines whether the build includes Swift Testing
                          support.
  --attachments-path <attachments-path>
                          Path where attachments should be written (Swift
                          Testing only). This path must be an existing
                          directory the current user can write to. If not
                          specified, any attachments created during testing are
                          discarded.
  --version               Show the version.
  -h, -help, --help       Show help information.

